  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency response to flood victims in Ouagadougou (project  BFA-09/F/25918/561 within Flash Appeal for Burkina Faso floods 2009). Beneficiaries: 125,000 flood-affected people including 20,000 children under 5 years old and 55,000 women.Objectives: save lives and protect livelihoods; reduce hunger and safeguard the nutritional status of vulnerable groups, esp. young children and women.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Livsuppeh&#xe5;llande matst&#xf6;d till 125000 offer f&#xf6;r &#xf6;versv&#xe4;mningskatastrofen i Burkina Faso 2009. Projektet &#xe4;r del i FNs Flash-appell under sektor/kluster mats&#xe4;kerhet.</narrative>
  </description>
